      "options": {
        "content": "Live from **hermes-logs** on `bearsnas:8181`. Filter: `event = 'api_end' AND total_tokens IS NOT NULL`.\n\nQueries are **capped at the last 7 days** (InfluxDB 3 Core 432-file scan limit). A wider time picker will not error; it still only returns those 7 days. Prompt share near 100% means spend is context (tool-loop history), not completion length.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.1",
      "title": "",
